  - title: 02 / Stabilize and point
    explanation: Calibrate the gyro, reduce actual body rates, acquire the primary
      star tracker, and settle a three-axis slew.
    caption: "GYRO  \u2022  STARS  \u2022  WHEELS"
    parts:
    - id: input
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.18, y: 0.71}
