  - title: 04 / Recover trusted attitude
    explanation: Remove W097 during a live link. Restore the wire, obtain a fresh
      primary fix, check coarse safety, reset and run a new two-pass mission.
    caption: "W097  \u2022  STALE  \u2022  RESET"
    parts:
